<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Tb-303 on nonpunctual</title><link>https://www.nonpunctual.org/tags/tb-303/</link><description>Recent content in Tb-303 on nonpunctual</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.nonpunctual.org/tags/tb-303/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>10 Ragas To a Disco Beat</title><link>https://www.nonpunctual.org/posts/10-ragas-to-a-disco-beat/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.nonpunctual.org/posts/10-ragas-to-a-disco-beat/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;In 1982, &lt;a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charanjit_Singh_%28musician%29" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Charanjit Singh&lt;/a&gt; released &lt;a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Synthesizing:_Ten_Ragas_to_a_Disco_Beat" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&amp;lsquo;Synthesizing: Ten Ragas To a Disco Beat&amp;rsquo;&lt;/a&gt; which is my favorite acid house album. (There are a lot of words in that sentence that don&amp;rsquo;t go together.) It was a marketplace flop from a musician &amp;amp; composer who otherwise had a long &amp;amp; successful career in the Indian 🇮🇳 music &amp;amp; film industries.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;I love talking about &lt;a href="https://www.nonpunctual.org/gear/boss-aw-3/#old-faithful" &gt;flops&lt;/a&gt;. Learning about &amp;amp; talking about &lt;a href="https://www.nonpunctual.org/gear/roland-super-jx-mks-70/#thoughts" &gt;flops&lt;/a&gt; makes me feel better. It gives me hope that so many of the things considered failures or &amp;ldquo;bad&amp;rdquo; often are really just out of phase - ahead or behind the rest of the world at the time of their release or invention.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Boss AW-3 Dynamic Wah</title><link>https://www.nonpunctual.org/gear/boss-aw-3/</link><pubDate>Tue, 07 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.nonpunctual.org/gear/boss-aw-3/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="photos--videos"&gt;&#10; Photos / Videos&#10; &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#photos--videos"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.nonpunctual.org/images/Boss%20AW-3%200.jpg"&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;alt="Boss AW-3"&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="images-grid"&gt;&#10; &lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="images-thumb" data-full="/images/Boss AW-3 1.jpg"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://www.nonpunctual.org/images/Boss%20AW-3%201.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="images-thumb" data-full="/images/Boss AW-3 2.jpg"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://www.nonpunctual.org/images/Boss%20AW-3%202.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="overview"&gt;&#10; Overview&#10; &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#overview"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;"&gt;&#10; &lt;iframe&#10; src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/H3IJbH1vo5o?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;mute=0" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;"&#10; allowfullscreen="true"&#10; title="YouTube Video"&#10; &gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Boss AW-3 home page (linked below) says &amp;lsquo;Unbelievable&amp;rsquo;. That&amp;rsquo;s for sure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://reverb.com/p/boss-aw-3-dynamic-wah" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Boss AW-3 on Reverb.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.boss.info/us/products/aw-3/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Boss AW-3 Product Page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="specification"&gt;&#10; Specification&#10; &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#specification"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>